; BIND Zone File excerpt for ChikGuard DNS for AI Discovery (DNS-AID)
; Include this in your public DNS zone configuration for chikguard.com
; Ensure the zone is signed with DNSSEC.

_index._agents.chikguard.com.   3600  IN  HTTPS  1  chikguard.com.  alpn="h2,http/1.1" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port
_a2a._agents.chikguard.com.     3600  IN  SVCB   1  chikguard.com.  alpn="a2a" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port
